OL,3,ARussell Brand tells court allegations
OL,4,Ahave been 'deeply traumatic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FRussell Brand has told a jury that
OL,10,Ffacing accusations of rape and sexual
OL,11,Fassault has been "deeply traumatic".
OL,13,FThe entertainer told the jury at his
OL,14,Ftrial that he has focused on the
OL,15,Fallegations "at the expense of my
OL,16,Fmarriage, my children and my health".
OL,18,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,19,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,20,Fassault, and one charge of attempted
OL,21,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
